ity by foot or scooter. Discover secrets, track NPC schedules, and unlock increasingly dangerous and lucrative opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/1b133042fe9e9bb9af28b3f07e09d95e.poster.avif?t=1787862902\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/1b133042fe9e9bb9af28b3f07e09d95e.webm?t=1787862902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/1b133042fe9e9bb9af28b3f07e09d95e.mp4?t=1787862902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/635c3a404f8b3bc81f4aa20e8ab99966.poster.avif?t=1787862902\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/635c3a404f8b3bc81f4aa20e8ab99966.webm?t=1787862902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/635c3a404f8b3bc81f4aa20e8ab99966.mp4?t=1787862902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY SOLO OR WITH FRIENDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run the store alone or with friends in co-op multiplayer. <strong>PLEASE NOTE: </strong>Co-op is temporarily disabled in the main build due to performance instability. Saves you create now will be co-op compatible when it returns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To play co-op today, switch to the <strong>Legacy</strong> branch (right-click the game in your Library → Properties → Betas → &quot;Legacy&quot;), which runs the June build and your older saves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Res